            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(i) Local ground transportation expense (airport bus, limousine, taxi) as reasonably incurred between the Employee's living quarters or Job Location and the airport or common carrier terminal at each end of the trip, (or when such ground transportation is not available between the Employee's home at the Base Location (or Hiring Location, if applicable) and the airport or common carrier terminal, an allowance of $0.36 per mile each way based on the distance in road miles between his or her home and such airport or common carrier terminal).",
